<p>   Triticale		 1		  84	  1	   39</p>
<p> TOTAL GRAIN	   9,488	89     788   10,605	2,573</p>
<p>Notes: (1) column shows this year's exports expressed as a percentage of last year's exports, not as a percentage change (2) wheat equivalent (3) durum equivalent (4) barley equivalent (5) rye equivalent.</p>
